      "mutable": false,
      "reflect": false,
      "attribute": "manual-activation",
      "optional": false,
      "description": "Keyboard activation policy. When `false` (default), arrow keys move\nfocus AND immediately activate the focused tab (automatic activation;\nmatches the MD3 reference and most nav bar implementations).\n\nWhen `true`, arrow keys only move focus — the user must press\n`Enter` / `Space` to activate. Use this when activation triggers\ndestructive or expensive work."
    },
